codex
I identified the earlier changes in the weights: remove anger dependence, add an EU logit offset, escalate critical alerts above a `0.7` error rate, and add a low-confidence escalation rule. The new gate will suppress maintenance alerts at or below `0.5` users. I will check all supplied labels and random inputs without training the model.
